      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Polish immigrants arrived in the 1870s to grow cotton, and Bremond still celebrates that heritage with an annual festival.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
